otateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" alt="blue downward pointing arrow" id="w-node-_47391e68-a003-6705-2fd1-c31d5a8054e2-67f16e7c" class="downward-arrow"/><div id="w-node-cd8001d6-25bf-5a53-10ba-d7a16dd87e8d-67f16e7c" style="display:none" class="div-memberships"><div id="w-node-_47391e68-a003-6705-2fd1-c31d5a8054e3-67f16e7c" class="text-memberships">Dutch Fund and Asset Management Association<br/></div></div></div><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-regulations-memberships"><h1 id="w-node-ded17ff8-99e6-9170-b48a-b59fb748e4b0-67f16e7c" data-w-id="ded17ff8-99e6-9170-b48a-b59fb748e4b0" class="heading-memberships"><strong>Holland Fintech</strong></h1><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/67d01323fdc24b1ec53044b7_blue%20arrow.png" loading="lazy" width="15" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" alt="blue downward pointing arrow" id="w-node-ded17ff8-99e6-9170-b48a-b59fb748e4b3-67f16e7c" class="downward-arrow"/><div style="display:none" class="div-memberships"><div id="w-node-ded17ff8-99e6-9170-b48a-b59fb748e4b4-67f16e7c" class="text-memberships">Holland Fintech<br/></div></div></div><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-regulations-memberships"><h1 id="w-node-b9c92fa0-1995-f679-b7b9-9c5ac7fe5c64-67f16e7c" data-w-id="b9c92fa0-1995-f679-b7b9-9c5ac7fe5c64" class="heading-memberships"><strong>VV&amp;A</strong></h1><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/67d01323fdc24b1ec53044b7_blue%20arrow.png" loading="lazy" width="15" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" alt="blue downward pointing arrow" id="w-node-b9c92fa0-1995-f679-b7b9-9c5ac7fe5c67-67f16e7c" class="downward-arrow"/><div id="w-node-_063e3243-4a5d-068f-1887-297934011be8-67f16e7c" style="display:none" class="div-memberships"><div id="w-node-b9c92fa0-1995-f679-b7b9-9c5ac7fe5c68-67f16e7c" class="text-memberships">Vereniging Vermogensbeheerders &amp; Adviseurs<br/></div></div></div><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div></div><div class="div-regulations"><h2>Exchange Memberships</h2><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-regulations-memberships"><h1 id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81a0-67f16e7c" data-w-id="0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81a0" class="heading-memberships"><strong>Eurex Exchange</strong></h1><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/67d01323fdc24b1ec53044b7_blue%20arrow.png" loading="lazy" width="15" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" alt="blue downward pointing arrow" id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81a3-67f16e7c" class="downward-arrow"/><div id="w-node-_2be33889-de7b-1f58-13a3-25952aa804f8-67f16e7c" style="display:none" class="div-memberships"><div id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81a4-67f16e7c" class="text-memberships">Eurex Exchange is an international exchange which primarily offers trading in European based derivatives. It is the largest European futures and options market. The products traded on this exchange vary from German and Swiss debt instruments to European stocks and various stock indexes.     <br/></div></div></div><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-regulations-memberships"><h1 id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81af-67f16e7c" data-w-id="0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81af" class="heading-memberships"><strong>Euronext Exchange</strong></h1><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/67d01323fdc24b1ec53044b7_blue%20arrow.png" loading="lazy" width="15" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" alt="blue downward pointing arrow" id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81b2-67f16e7c" class="downward-arrow"/><div id="w-node-f8e4fae7-40fb-cdb1-9f79-30c74f72e6d9-67f16e7c" style="display:none" class="div-memberships"><div id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81b3-67f16e7c" class="text-memberships">Euronext Exchange is a pan-European bourse that offers various trading and post-trade services. Traded assets include regulated equities, exchange-traded funds, warrants and certificates, bonds, derivatives, commodities, foreign exchange as well as indices<br/></div></div></div><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-regulations-memberships"><h1 id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81b8-67f16e7c" data-w-id="0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81b8" class="heading-memberships"><strong>ICE Exchange</strong></h1><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/67d01323fdc24b1ec53044b7_blue%20arrow.png" loading="lazy" width="15" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 0, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0)" alt="blue downward pointing arrow" id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81bb-67f16e7c" class="downward-arrow"/><div id="w-node-_2e0d28a9-3ffe-c914-ddc4-bb6a5c96099c-67f16e7c" style="display:none" class="div-memberships"><div id="w-node-_0cb3a64a-28d5-8448-fb2a-532a47ff81bc-67f16e7c" class="text-memberships">Intercontinental Exchange, Inc. is an American company formed in 2000 that operates global financial exchanges and clearing houses and provides mortgage technology, data and listing services.<br/></div></div></div><div class="div-regulation-devider"></div></div></section><section Market-Insights="" class="section-footer"><div class="w-layout-grid footer-main-wrapper"><div class="footer-logo-wrapper"><a href="/" class="footer-logo-link w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/6798e189e731f1d6cbc23738_AFS_Group_Line_Logo_RGB_White_2400.png" loading="lazy" width="229" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 71vw, 229px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/6798e189e731f1d6cbc23738_AFS_Group_Line_Logo_RGB_White_2400-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/6798e189e731f1d6cbc23738_AFS_Group_Line_Logo_RGB_White_2400-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/6798e189e731f1d6cbc23738_AFS_Group_Line_Logo_RGB_White_2400-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67862b2b918229aaf5b0e12b/6798e189e731f1d6cbc23738_AFS_Group_Line_Logo_RGB_White_2400-p-1600.png 1600w, https://c